i/Knight%20Armor\"><img alt=\"Knight Armor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Knight_Armor_687863.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Spider%20Silk\"><img alt=\"Spider Silk\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spider_Silk_c6e732.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wand%20of%20Inferno\"><img alt=\"Wand of Inferno\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wand_of_Inferno_ea3581.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">9.80<br/>December 12, 2012<br/>Winter Update 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Drillworm Caves</b> can be found in the southern part of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Mines\">city mine</a>, near the <a href=\"#/wiki/Steamship\">Steamship</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32657,32010,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32657, 32010, 13)</a>).\n</p>\n<div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-1\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 256px; height: 256px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -908px;left:-786px;clip:rect(908px 1042px 1164px 786px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"2048\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_13_92aa92.png\" width=\"2560\"/></span></span>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:256px;width:128px;left:0px;top:0px;border-right:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:128px;width:256px;left:0px;top:0px;border-bottom:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:right;background-color:#DDDDDD;padding:0px 3px;\"><div class=\"minimap_clic\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32658,32012,13\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32658, 32012, 13)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div></div></div></div>\n<p>Upper floor of the cave can be considered as a free account alternative to <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron%20Earth%20Elemental%20Cave\">Edron Earth Elemental Cave</a>.\nLower floor consists of two separate caves, western and eastern. Western cave is the easier one - you will encounter only two <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyvern\">Wyverns</a> next to the entrance. Paladins can hunt here with ease from level 75, using <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Wall%20Rune\">Fire Wall Runes</a> if necessary. Eastern cave is more tricky. There are three <a href=\"#/wiki/Drillworm\">Drillworms</a> close to the entrance, which can be lured one by one, but it will limit the room for maneuver. What's more, there are no <a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Spider\">Giant Spiders</a> in that cave.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Upper Floor Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Carrion%20Worm\"><img alt=\"Carrion Worm\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Carrion_Worm_3d8101.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Carrion%20Worm\">Carrion Worm</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">70</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">145</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">45 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-45× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Carrion%20Worm%20Fang\">Carrion Worm Fang</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Worm\">Worm</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Coal\">Coal</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\"><img alt=\"Stone Golem\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stone_Golem_9e60ec.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\">Stone Golem</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">160</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">270</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">110 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-40× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>0-4× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Stone\">Small Stone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sulphurous%20Stone\">Sulphurous Stone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Power%20Ring\">Power Ring</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin%20Sword\">Carlin Sword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Iron%20Ore\">Iron Ore</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Ancient Stone (rare)</li>\n<li>Shiny Stone (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Coal\">Coal</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Piece%20of%20Marble%20Rock\">Piece of Marble Rock</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Ring\">Crystal Ring</a> (very rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Gem\">Red Gem</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Earth%20Elemental\"><img alt=\"Earth Elemental\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Earth_Elemental_71fa7f.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Earth%20Elemental\">Earth Elemental</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">550</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">650</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">328+</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-130× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>0-30× <a href=\"#/wiki/Earth%20Arrow\">Earth Arrow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>0-10× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Stone\">Small Stone</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blank%20Rune\">Blank Rune</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Lump of Earth (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Mana%20Potion\">Strong Mana Potion</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Might%20Ring\">Might Ring</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Heavily Rusted Armor (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Topaz\">Small Topaz</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Clay Lump (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Coal\">Coal</a> (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Wyvern\"><img alt=\"Wyvern\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wyvern_a6f445.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Wyvern\">Wyvern</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">515</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">795</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">144</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\